DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The  mmaannsseecctt command prints the source code of the _s_e_c_t_i_o_n of the given
       manual‐page files.  If no files are specified, the  standard  input  is
       used.

       _s_e_c_t_i_o_n is a PCRE2 regular expression.

       The TTHH line is unconditionally printed.

       The  output  of  this  program  is  suitable for piping to the ggrrooffff(1)
       pipeline.

